WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Quantquer engineering in practice.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Compare the controlled input with recorded MI-GAN output.
The model used a supplied person mask and ran on a desktop CPU.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Public demo with a sample layout. Review the robot placement
and 3D workcell in the founder’s independent tool.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Recorded single-GPU run. The second CUDA job waits for the GPU.
The CPU-only job overlaps the first CUDA job.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Four-stage photonic mesh software simulation. Ideal reference.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Injected phase drift and attenuation change simulated outputs.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Open-source paper-evidence checks numbers against synthetic text.
It rejects a number found only in another context.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Discuss your engineering project at quantquer.com.
